OL,3,GNEWSAGreens call for data centres pause
OL,4,Aand no nuclear
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Green Party's deputy leader says a
OL,7,Fnew generation of small nuclear power
OL,8,Fstations is not a solution to rising
OL,9,Fenergy bills.
OL,11,FThe government hopes to have a new
OL,12,Fgeneration of modular reactors up and
OL,13,Frunning in the mid-2030s, including 12
OL,14,Fplanned for Hartlepool, but Rachel
OL,15,FMillward told the BBC new nuclear still
OL,16,Ftakes too long to develop.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
