OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGreens call for data centres pause
OL,4,Aand no nuclear
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking ahead of her party's annual
OL,7,Fconference in Brighton, Millward also
OL,8,Fsaid the party was looking to pause the
OL,9,Fdevelopment of data centres to ensure
OL,10,Fthey are built in more sustainable
OL,11,Fways.
OL,13,FWork has already begun on a giant
OL,14,Fartificial intelligence campus at
OL,15,FCambois in Northumberland, while part
OL,16,Fof the Teesworks site has been
OL,17,Fearmarked for a data centre.
